<title>ITALY: Bank Italy sets 7.0 trln lire reverse repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank Italy sets 7.0 trln lire reverse repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 7.0 trillion lire reverse repurchase tender for today for government securities to be repurchased by November 25.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 4.0 trillion lire on November 11, the maximium accepted rate stood at 8.03 percent and the average rate also stood as 8.03 percent.</p>
</text>
